          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#0b1220;--accent:#ff6b6b;--muted:#5b6b7a;--card:#fff6f6}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#fffbfb 100%)}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;border-bottom:6px solid rgba(255,107,107,0.08)}\\n    .logo{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo .mark{width:56px;height:56px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:56px 28px}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:34px;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--ink)}\\n    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .hero img{width:100%;max-width:420px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .grid{padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(11,18,32,0.06)}\\n    h2{margin-top:0}\\n    ul{padding-left:18px}\\n    .plan-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .plan{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px dashed rgba(11,18,32,0.06)}\\n    .micro{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{padding:28px;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,0.04);font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mark\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Compassionate clinical care with a steady compass</h1>\\n        <p>I work with adults navigating anxiety, relational ruptures, life transitions and the lasting effects of trauma. My approach is informed by evidence and attuned to the whole person — body, mind, and meaning.</p>\\n        <p><strong>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</strong>, <span style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{LICENSE}}</span></p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"illustration\\\">\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Where people often start</h2>\\n          <p>Clients typically seek support for persistent worry, sleep disruption, relationship friction, burnout, or for integration after a difficult life event. Below is a brief orientation to how I see presenting concerns.</p>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Anxiety that feels constant or increasing</li>\\n            <li>Unresolved relational pain or communication breakdowns</li>\\n            <li>After-effects of acute or complex trauma</li>\\n            <li>Chronic stress, compassion fatigue, or workplace burnout</li>\\n            <li>Major life transitions: parenting, separation, grief, career shifts</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>How I begin: diagnostic mapping</h2>\\n          <p>Our first sessions are gently investigative. We map symptoms, strengths, patterns, and life context. This is collaborative — I offer frameworks, you offer the lived experience. Together we identify small, practical shifts that reduce suffering and increase capacity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>The mosaic plan</h2>\\n          <p>Clinical work is rarely linear. I propose layered plans that can include short-term skill work, weekly psychotherapy, or monthly reflective coaching. A typical pathway includes:</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"plan-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"plan\\\"><strong>Foundational Phase</strong> — 4–8 sessions: stabilization, skill-building, sleep and anxiety tools.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"plan\\\"><strong>Depth Phase</strong> — ongoing weekly work for processing relational patterns and trauma.</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"plan\\\"><strong>Integration Phase</strong> — tapering support, relapse prevention, and meaning-making.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Quick daily practices</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n            <div><strong>2-minute anchor:</strong> notice breath, feel feet, name one safe thing.</div>\\n            <div><strong>Evening review:</strong> jot one small win before bed.</div>\\n            <div><strong>Boundary cue:</strong> a 30-second grounding pause before saying yes or no.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Investment & options</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"price\\\">Individual session: $150–220</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Sliding scale available for limited spots. I offer a reduced-fee cohort for people in early recovery from burnout — inquire for details.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"fees.html\\\">View full fee schedule</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Next step</h2>\\n          <p>If this feels like the right fit, book a 20-minute consultation to see if we can work together.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Private practice, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:520px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Clinical notes</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">I practice within the scope of outpatient psychotherapy. Sessions are confidential except where disclosure is required by law (risk of harm to self or others, abuse of a minor or vulnerable adult). This site is not a crisis service. If you are in immediate danger, please call local emergency services or a crisis line.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Specialties — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#082031;--accent:#08a3b5;--muted:#476b7b}\\n    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);margin:0}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 26px;border-bottom:8px solid rgba(8,163,181,0.06)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{padding:48px 26px;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero .lead{max-width:720px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:30px}\\n    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .illustration{width:200px}\\n    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;padding:28px 26px}\\n    .spec{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8feff,#fff);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border-left:6px solid var(--accent)}\\n    .spec h3{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .spec p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .aside{padding:28px 26px}\\n    .micro{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{padding:26px;border-top:1px solid rgba(8,32,49,0.04);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:760px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}.illustration{width:100%}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"lead\\\">\\n        <h1>Specialized support for the work that matters to you</h1>\\n        <p>Therapy that centers safety, curiosity, and rhythm. I pair somatic awareness, relational focus, and cognitive strategies to support sustainable change.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <img class=\\\"illustration\\\" src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"cards\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n        <h3>Anxiety & Persistent Worry</h3>\\n        <p>Practical stabilization, exposure-informed skills, and rhythm-building to reduce reactivity and widen your capacity for living.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n        <h3>Trauma & Post-Traumatic Reactions</h3>\\n        <p>Trauma-informed care that prioritizes safety, pacing, and integration. We work within your window of tolerance to restore regulation.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n        <h3>Relationship Repair & Communication</h3>\\n        <p>Support for improving boundaries, repairing ruptures, and navigating transitions in partnerships or family systems.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n        <h3>Burnout, Career & Life Transition</h3>\\n        <p>Explore values, re-balance capacity, and recover agency after prolonged stress or major life shifts.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"background:#f3fafb;padding:18px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Is this a fit?</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">You might begin here if you notice patterns that repeat despite your best effort, or if you feel stuck after a life change. Not sure? A short consult helps clarify goals and fit.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a 20-min consult</a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,32,49,0.04)\\\">\\n          <strong>Short-term support</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">6–12 sessions for targeted symptom reduction and new skills.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,32,49,0.04)\\\">\\n          <strong>Ongoing psychotherapy</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Weekly work for deeper pattern change and integration.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border-left:6px solid var(--accent)\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Micro-practices you can try</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n          <div><strong>Grounding chair check:</strong> 60-seconds noticing breath and pressure of seat.</div>\\n          <div><strong>Two-question pause:</strong> \\\"What do I need right now?\\\" and \\\"What would help most?\\\"</div>\\n          <div><strong>Boundary micro-script:</strong> a prepared 15-second phrase to protect energy.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"padding:28px 26px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Investment options</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">I offer several ways to engage depending on need and capacity. The frames below are examples; exact costs are on the Fees page.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,32,49,0.04);min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Drop-in</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\\\">$160 per session</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">For people who want flexibility without commitment.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,32,49,0.04);min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Short course</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\\\">Bundle pricing available</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Structured 6–8 session plan to learn practical skills.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(8,32,49,0.04);min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Monthly cohort</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\\\">Subscription options</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">A cost-effective, community-supported rhythm for regular practice.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"fees.html\\\">See complete fee schedule</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-bottom:6px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{LICENSE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:640px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n        <strong>Therapeutic boundaries & safety</strong>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">I maintain confidentiality within legal limits. If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, call local emergency services or a crisis line. My practice is not a substitute for emergency care.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#102127;--accent:#ff9f1c;--muted:#6b7b86}\\n    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Arial;color:var(--ink);margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf5)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:6px solid rgba(255,159,28,0.06)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{padding:40px 24px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero img{width:220px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:28px}\\n    .wrap{padding:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px}\\n    .box{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(16,33,39,0.04)}\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .num{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700}\\n    .micro{margin-top:8px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{padding:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(16,33,39,0.04);font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>How I work: an ethical, paced, and relational model</h1>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">My practice blends evidence-based techniques, somatic awareness, and compassionate inquiry. Below is an outline of the steps you can expect.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"pattern\\\">\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Assessment & shared planning</h2>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Early sessions focus on building safety and mapping resources. We create a short care plan with explicit goals and measurable next steps, revisited regularly.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">A staged process</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"steps\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><div><strong>Stabilize</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Skills for regulation, sleep, and managing intense moments.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><div><strong>Explore</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Kind, focused exploration of patterns, beliefs, and relationships.</div></div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><div><strong>Integrate</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Practice new ways of relating and living, with support for relapse prevention.</div></div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Therapeutic stance</h2>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">I hold a nonjudgmental, curious stance: clear boundaries, attunement, and an invitation to agency. I work to make the therapeutic frame predictable and safe.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Micro-habits I share early</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n            <div><strong>Three-minute morning anchor</strong>: breath, intention, and one small doable task.</div>\\n            <div><strong>Boundary rehearsal</strong>: a short script you can try in real situations.</div>\\n            <div><strong>Evening consolidation</strong>: one insight and one next step recorded in a notebook.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Programs I offer</h3>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff6ef,#fff);border-left:6px solid var(--accent)\\\">\\n              <strong>Embodied Resilience</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">8-week small-group for regulation and relational skills.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(16,33,39,0.04)\\\">\\n              <strong>Roots & Renewal</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">12-week individualized pathway for trauma integration.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Pricing frames</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">I typically offer single sessions, short-course bundles, and subscription-style cohorts. Sessions are billed per visit; bundled programs include a modest discount.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)\\\">Session range: $140–220</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Full fees & insurance</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"box\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Ready to begin?</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">A brief consult helps us decide if we should move forward and which pathway fits your needs.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:640px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n        <strong>Confidentiality & scope</strong>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">All disclosures in therapy are confidential except where required by law. I do not provide emergency services. If you are experiencing a crisis or imminent danger, please call emergency services or your local crisis line immediately.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
